  "description": "U.S. Marine Corps CH-53E Super Stallions with Heavy Marine Helicopter Squadron 464 and 461 and MV-22B Ospreys with Marine Medium Tiltrotor Training Squadron 204 retrograde back to Marine Corps Air Station New River, Sept. 19, 2018. . Hurricane Florence impacted Marine Corps Base Camp Lejeune and MCAS New River with periods of strong winds, heavy rains, flooding of urban and low lying areas, flash floods and coastal storm surges. (U.S. Marine Corps video by Lance Cpl. Evan Falls.)",
